From 1810ff4d7d40dde830a93eb3fd4dec5112fda00d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Eden (Doris) build" <doris@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:05:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 29/51] Eden (Doris): core layout - GPU emulation thread on the
 fastest core (setting, on by default)

The performance report from a Thor at ClusterTune's Medium underclock showed Eden's GPU thread as the
busiest thread (up to ~75% of a core) mostly running on the A715 middle cores while the X3 prime core
sat idle. Doris now pins the GPU thread to the fastest cpufreq cluster and the other heavy emulator
threads (emulated CPU cores, VulkanWorker, VulkanPresent, GPUFencingThread, HostTiming) to the middle
clusters, so they don't compete with it. On two-cluster CPUs both share the big cluster; on one
cluster nothing changes. doris_core_layout 0 restores Eden's behaviour.
